<div class="page-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">PAUSE. NOTICE. KEEP GROWING.</span><h1>Your week, in perspective.</h1><p>Real activity, a little reflection and a useful next step.</p></div><div class="page-actions"><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" data-api-button="<?= e(route_url('/api/reports/generate')) ?>"><?= icon('chart',15) ?> Generate last week</button></div></div><?php if($reports): ?><?php foreach($reports as $r): ?><article class="card weekly-report"><div class="report-header"><div><h2><?= niceDate($r['week_start'],'M j') ?> – <?= niceDate($r['week_end'],'M j, Y') ?></h2><p>A reflection based on your recorded learning activity.</p></div><span class="badge badge-neutral">WEEKLY REFLECTION</span></div><div class="report-stats"><div><strong><?= (int)$r['lessons_completed'] ?></strong><span>lessons completed</span></div><div><strong><?= (int)$r['quizzes_attempted'] ?></strong><span>quizzes submitted</span></div><div><strong><?= (int)$r['assignments_submitted'] ?></strong><span>assignments submitted</span></div><div><strong><?= number($r['xp_earned']) ?></strong><span>experience points earned</span></div></div><div class="report-details"><span><?= icon('target',14) ?> <?= (int)$r['goals_met'] ?> daily goals met</span><span><?= icon('flame',14) ?> <?= (int)$r['streak_days'] ?> qualifying / protected days</span><span><?= icon('lightbulb',14) ?> Average quiz score: <?= $r['average_quiz_score']!==null?round($r['average_quiz_score']).'%':'No graded attempts' ?></span></div><?php $pathSnapshots=\Learnow\Repositories\DB::all('SELECT * FROM weekly_report_paths WHERE report_id=?',[$r['id']]); if($pathSnapshots): ?><div style="margin-top:20px"><?php foreach($pathSnapshots as $snapshot): ?><div class="key-value"><span><?= e($snapshot['path_title']) ?></span><strong><?= (int)$snapshot['lessons_completed'] ?> / <?= (int)$snapshot['lesson_total'] ?> lessons by week end</strong></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><?php endif; ?><div class="report-next"><?= icon('sparkles',21) ?><div><strong>Your next little step</strong><p><?= e($r['suggested_next']) ?></p></div></div></article><?php endforeach; ?><?php pagination($total,12); ?><?php else: ?><section class="card"><?php emptyState('chart','Every week has a little story.','Generate your previous-week report, or keep learning and let the scheduled report job bring your progress together.','/my-learning','Find my next little win'); ?></section><?php endif; ?><div class="notice info" style="margin-top:23px"><?= icon('info',18) ?><p>Reports use your timezone and recorded completions, attempts, submissions and rewards. Learning time is not reported because this build does not reliably measure active study time. Opening a tab never inflates your report.</p></div>
